# Testing

## Suites

- Components: `__tests__/*Modal*.test.tsx` (jsdom)
- API: `__tests__/api.*.test.js` (node + mongodb-memory-server)

## Patterns

- Use helpers from `__tests__/helpers/apiTestUtils.js`
- For authorized API tests, seed full access (`seedAdminUser` or `buildFullAdminPermissions`)
- Assert **403** for unprivileged users on protected routes
- Keep `"@jest-environment node"` on API test files

```js
// ✅ Admin happy path + denial
await seedAdminUser();
// ... expect 200 on CRUD

const viewer = await seedUnprivilegedUser();
// ... expect 403
```

- Run `npm test` after API or modal changes
